msgstr "揭示"

#: tarot_strings.lua:255
msgid "Reveal next card"
msgstr "揭示下一张牌"

#: tarot_strings.lua:256
msgid ""
"Tap an empty space to add a card. Press and hold an empty space to name its po"
"sition. Tap a hidden card to reveal it, and tap a revealed card to open its de"
"tails. Press and hold a card to name its position, move, delete, undo, or hide"
" it."
msgstr "轻触空位添加牌；长按空位可命名该位置。轻触牌背可翻开，轻触已翻开的牌可查看详情。长按牌可命名位置、移动、删除、撤销或盖回。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:257
msgid "Click the next card to reveal it. Press and hold to reveal all remaining cards."
msgstr "点击下一张卡牌以揭示。长按可揭示所有剩余卡牌。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:258
msgid "Reveal all remaining cards?"
msgstr "揭示所有剩余卡牌？"

#: tarot_strings.lua:259
#, lua-format
msgid "Revealed %d of %d"
msgstr "已揭示 %d / %d 张"

#: tarot_strings.lua:260
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: tarot_strings.lua:261
msgid "About Tarot and Lenormand"
msgstr "关于塔罗牌与雷诺曼牌"

#: tarot_strings.lua:262
msgid ""
"Tarot is a deck of 78 cards, divided into Major Arcana (22) and Minor Arcana ("
"56), used for reflection and self-knowledge. The Lenormand deck has 36 cards w"
"ith direct symbolism for practical guidance.\n"
"\n"
"Credits for the free card images:\n"
"• Lenormand Cards by Yve Lepkowski (https://stolen-thyme.com/)\n"
"• Tarot Cards by Luciella Elisabeth Scarlett (https://luciellaes.itch.io/)"
msgstr ""
"塔罗牌由 78 张牌组成，分为大阿卡纳（22 张）和小阿卡纳（56 张），用于反思与自我认识。雷诺曼牌组有 36 张牌，以直接的象征意义提供实用指引。\n"
"\n"
"免费牌面图片鸣谢：\n"
"• Yve Lepkowski 的 Lenormand Cards（https://stolen-thyme.com/）\n"
"• Luciella Elisabeth Scarlett 的 Tarot Cards（https://luciellaes.itch.io/）"

#: tarot_strings.lua:267
msgid "view in book"
msgstr "在手册中查看"

#: tarot_strings.lua:268
msgid "Keywords"
msgstr "关键词"

#: tarot_strings.lua:269
msgid "Planet / Sign"
msgstr "行星 / 星座"

#: tarot_strings.lua:270
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "时机"

#: tarot_strings.lua:271
#, lua-format
msgid "Card %d — %s (%s)"
msgstr "第 %d 张牌 — %s（%s）"

#: tarot_strings.lua:272
msgid "Add meaning to card"
msgstr "为卡牌添加释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:273
msgid "Add highlighted text"
msgstr "添加划线文本"

#: tarot_strings.lua:274
msgid "Choose the deck"
msgstr "选择牌组"

#: tarot_strings.lua:275
msgid "Choose a Tarot card"
msgstr "选择塔罗牌"

#: tarot_strings.lua:276
msgid "Choose a Lenormand card"
msgstr "选择雷诺曼牌"

#: tarot_strings.lua:277
msgid "Choose the meaning type"
msgstr "选择释义类型"

#: tarot_strings.lua:278
msgid "Upright meaning"
msgstr "正位释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:279
msgid "Reversed meaning"
msgstr "逆位释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:280
msgid "Personal Meaning"
msgstr "个人释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:282
msgid "Edit Personal Meanings"
msgstr "编辑个人释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:283
msgid ""
"You can highlight passages in books and add those highlights as Personal Meani"
"ng for any card. This editor also lets you insert, edit, or remove Personal Me"
"anings manually."
msgstr "你可以在书中划线，并把这些划线内容添加为任意卡牌的个人释义。这个编辑器也可以手动新增、编辑或移除个人释义。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:284
msgid "Add Personal Meaning"
msgstr "新增个人释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:285
msgid "Edit Personal Meaning"
msgstr "编辑个人释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:286
msgid "Remove Personal Meaning"
msgstr "移除个人释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:287
msgid "Choose a Personal Meaning"
msgstr "选择个人释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:288
msgid "No Personal Meanings yet."
msgstr "还没有个人释义。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:289
msgid "Write the meaning here"
msgstr "在这里写下释义"

#: tarot_strings.lua:290
msgid "Personal Meaning updated."
msgstr "个人释义已更新。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:291
msgid "Personal Meaning removed."
msgstr "个人释义已移除。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:292
msgid "Remove this Personal Meaning?"
msgstr "移除此个人释义吗？"

#: tarot_strings.lua:293
msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"

#: tarot_strings.lua:294
msgid "Meaning added to the card."
msgstr "释义已添加到卡牌。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:295
msgid "No highlighted text was found."
msgstr "未找到划线文本。"

#: tarot_strings.lua:296
msgid "Unknown book"
msgstr "未知书籍"

#: tarot_strings.lua:297 _meta.lua:21
msgid ""
"Draw Tarot and Lenormand cards for reflection, save readings, and browse the c"
"omplete card book."
msgstr "抽取塔罗牌和雷诺曼牌进行反思、保存解读，并浏览完整的牌义手册。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:9
msgid "The Fool"
msgstr "愚者"

#: tarot_cards.lua:10
msgid "New beginning, spontaneity, faith, risk"
msgstr "新开始、自发、信念、冒险"

#: tarot_cards.lua:11
msgid "Uranus"
msgstr "天王星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:12
msgid "Immediate, unpredictable"
msgstr "立即、不可预测"

#: tarot_cards.lua:13
msgid ""
"New beginnings. Spontaneity. Take a leap of faith. Venture without fear, the u"
"niverse supports you."
msgstr "新的开始。顺其自然。凭信念勇敢一跃。无惧前行，宇宙会支持你。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:14
msgid ""
"Recklessness. Lack of direction. Think before acting. Blind risk may bring con"
"sequences."
msgstr "鲁莽。缺乏方向。行动前先思考。盲目冒险可能带来后果。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:18
msgid "The Magician"
msgstr "魔术师"

#: tarot_cards.lua:19
msgid "Power, skill, manifestation, focus"
msgstr "力量、技能、显化、专注"

#: tarot_cards.lua:20
msgid "Mercury"
msgstr "水星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:21
msgid "Fast, now is the time"
msgstr "迅速，现在正是时候"

#: tarot_cards.lua:22
msgid ""
"Personal power. Skill. You have everything you need. Manifest your desires wit"
"h confidence."
msgstr "个人力量。能力。你已拥有所需的一切。满怀信心地让愿望成真。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:23
msgid "Manipulation. Wasted talent. Deceit. Beware of illusions of power."
msgstr "操控。浪费天赋。欺骗。警惕权力的幻象。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:27
msgid "The High Priestess"
msgstr "女祭司"

#: tarot_cards.lua:28
msgid "Intuition, mystery, subconscious, wisdom"
msgstr "直觉、神秘、潜意识、智慧"

#: tarot_cards.lua:29
msgid "Moon"
msgstr "月亮"

#: tarot_cards.lua:30
msgid "Lunar cycles, 28 days"
msgstr "月相周期、28 天"

#: tarot_cards.lua:31
msgid ""
"Intuition. Mystery. Trust your inner voice. Hidden knowledge reveals itself in"
" silence."
msgstr "直觉。神秘。聆听内在的声音。答案会在静默中显现。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:32
msgid ""
"Secrets revealed. Intuitive disconnection. Silence broken. Listen to your inne"
"r voice again."
msgstr "秘密被揭开。忽视直觉。表面化。重新聆听你内在的声音。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:36
msgid "The Empress"
msgstr "皇后"

#: tarot_cards.lua:37
msgid "Abundance, fertility, nature, nurturing"
msgstr "丰盛、生育、自然、滋养"

#: tarot_cards.lua:38
msgid "Venus"
msgstr "金星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:39
msgid "9 months, spring"
msgstr "9 个月、春季"

#: tarot_cards.lua:40
msgid "Abundance. Fertility. Nurture yourself. Nature flourishes around you."
msgstr "丰盛。创造力。滋养。你所悉心照料的一切都会蓬勃生长。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:41
msgid "Neglect. Creative block. Dependence. Return to tending your inner garden."
msgstr "忽视。创造力受阻。过度依赖。照料好你的内在花园。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:45
msgid "The Emperor"
msgstr "皇帝"

#: tarot_cards.lua:46
msgid "Authority, structure, leadership, stability"
msgstr "权威、结构、领导力、稳定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:47
msgid "Aries"
msgstr "白羊座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:48
msgid "1 year, soon"
msgstr "1 年、不久"

#: tarot_cards.lua:49
msgid "Authority. Structure. Take control. Firm leadership brings stability."
msgstr "权威。结构。领导力。通过纪律与责任建立稳定。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:50
msgid "Tyranny. Rigidity. Lack of discipline. Excess control suffocates."
msgstr "专横。僵化。滥用权力。过度控制令人窒息。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:54
msgid "The Hierophant"
msgstr "教皇"

#: tarot_cards.lua:55
msgid "Tradition, wisdom, guidance, teaching"
msgstr "传统、智慧、指引、教导"

#: tarot_cards.lua:56
msgid "Taurus"
msgstr "金牛座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:57
msgid "5 weeks, slow but steady"
msgstr "5 周、缓慢但稳健"

#: tarot_cards.lua:58
msgid "Tradition. Wisdom. Seek guidance. Masters appear when the student is ready."
msgstr "传统。精神指引。学习。学生准备好时，老师自会出现。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:59
msgid ""
"Rebellion. Dogma. Necessary questioning. Breaking with traditions can be liber"
"ating."
msgstr "反叛。挑战教条。个人信念。打破规则也可能带来自由。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:63
msgid "The Lovers"
msgstr "恋人"

#: tarot_cards.lua:64
msgid "Love, choice, harmony, partnership"
msgstr "爱情、选择、和谐、伴侣关系"

#: tarot_cards.lua:65
msgid "Gemini"
msgstr "双子座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:66
msgid "Imminent decision"
msgstr "决定迫在眉睫"

#: tarot_cards.lua:67
msgid "Love. Choice. Harmony in relationships. The heart knows the way."
msgstr "爱。重要的选择。和谐的结合。心知道正确的道路。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:68
msgid "Conflict. Imbalance. Difficult decision. Avoid impulsive choices in love."
msgstr "冲突。关系失衡。冲动的选择。先让你的价值观保持一致。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:72
msgid "The Chariot"
msgstr "战车"

#: tarot_cards.lua:73
msgid "Victory, determination, control, progress"
msgstr "胜利、决心、掌控、进展"

#: tarot_cards.lua:74
msgid "Cancer"
msgstr "巨蟹座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:75 tarot_cards.lua:288
msgid "7 weeks"
msgstr "7 周"

#: tarot_cards.lua:76
msgid ""
"Victory. Determination. Move forward with confidence. Triumph awaits the perse"
"verant."
msgstr "胜利。决心。掌控相反的力量。坚持不懈地向前。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:77
msgid ""
"Lack of direction. Defeat. Loss of control. Reevaluate your route before proce"
"eding."
msgstr "缺乏方向。失去控制。受挫。重新评估路线后再继续。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:81
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "力量"

#: tarot_cards.lua:82
msgid "Courage, inner strength, compassion, mastery"
msgstr "勇气、内在力量、慈悲、驾驭"

#: tarot_cards.lua:83
msgid "Leo"
msgstr "狮子座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:84
msgid "8 weeks"
msgstr "8 周"

#: tarot_cards.lua:85
msgid "Courage. Inner strength. Master your impulses with kindness, not violence."
msgstr "勇气。内在力量。以温柔驾驭本能。善意胜过蛮力。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:86
msgid ""
"Weakness. Insecurity. Lack of self-control. True strength comes from vulnerabi"
"lity."
msgstr "软弱。缺乏自信。压抑本能。在脆弱中重新找回力量。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:90
msgid "The Hermit"
msgstr "隐者"

#: tarot_cards.lua:91
msgid "Introspection, solitude, wisdom, inner search"
msgstr "内省、独处、智慧、向内探寻"

#: tarot_cards.lua:92
msgid "Virgo"
msgstr "处女座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:93
msgid "9 months, slow"
msgstr "9 个月、缓慢"

#: tarot_cards.lua:94
msgid "Introspection. Inner wisdom. Seek silence. The light you seek is within you."
msgstr "内省。主动独处。内在智慧。你寻找的答案就在自己心中。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:95
msgid ""
"Isolation. Loneliness. Refusing to see the truth. Prolonged retreat becomes es"
"cape."
msgstr "孤立。孤独。拒绝指引。别把独处变成逃避。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:99
msgid "Wheel of Fortune"
msgstr "命运之轮"

#: tarot_cards.lua:100
msgid "Change, destiny, cycles, luck"
msgstr "变化、命运、周期、好运"

#: tarot_cards.lua:101
msgid "Jupiter"
msgstr "木星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:102
msgid "In motion, cyclical"
msgstr "正在运转、周期性"

#: tarot_cards.lua:103
msgid "Change. Destiny. Luck is turning in your favor. Everything passes, cycles renew."
msgstr "变化。命运。周期在转动。接受无常，生命的循环会不断更新。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:104
msgid ""
"Bad luck. Resistance to change. Negative cycle. Accept that nothing is permane"
"nt."
msgstr "厄运。抗拒变化。失去掌控。记住，没有什么是永恒不变的。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:108
msgid "Justice"
msgstr "正义"

#: tarot_cards.lua:109
msgid "Balance, truth, law, cause and effect"
msgstr "平衡、真相、法律、因果"

#: tarot_cards.lua:110
msgid "Libra"
msgstr "天秤座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:111
msgid "Under review, fair"
msgstr "审理之中、公正"

#: tarot_cards.lua:112
msgid "Balance. Truth. Justice will prevail. Reap what you have sown with serenity."
msgstr "平衡。真相。因果。你将收获自己播下的种子。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:113
msgid "Injustice. Dishonesty. Consequences coming. The scales weigh against you now."
msgstr "不公。偏见。逃避责任。当你背离真相时，天平会向你倾斜。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:117
msgid "The Hanged Man"
msgstr "倒吊人"

#: tarot_cards.lua:118
msgid "Sacrifice, suspension, new perspective, surrender"
msgstr "牺牲、悬置、新视角、臣服"

#: tarot_cards.lua:119
msgid "Neptune"
msgstr "海王星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:120
msgid "Indeterminate, pause"
msgstr "时间未定、暂停"

#: tarot_cards.lua:121
msgid "Sacrifice. New perspective. Let go, trust. Sometimes stopping is advancing."
msgstr "牺牲。暂停。新的视角。有时停下来就是前进。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:122
msgid "Stagnation. Procrastination. Resist change. The pause has become paralysis."
msgstr "停滞。拖延。无谓的牺牲。别把耐心变成瘫痪。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:126
msgid "Death"
msgstr "死神"

#: tarot_cards.lua:127
msgid "Transformation, ending, rebirth, transition"
msgstr "转化、结束、重生、过渡"

#: tarot_cards.lua:128
msgid "Scorpio"
msgstr "天蝎座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:129
msgid "Autumn, shortly"
msgstr "秋季、不久"

#: tarot_cards.lua:130
msgid ""
"Transformation. End of a cycle. Rebirth near. The old dies so the new can be b"
"orn."
msgstr "转化。必要的结束。重生。旧事物消逝，新事物才能诞生。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:131
msgid ""
"Resistance to change. Stagnation. Fear of endings. Let go of what no longer se"
"rves."
msgstr "抗拒变化。害怕结束。停滞。放下已不再有用的事物。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:135
msgid "Temperance"
msgstr "节制"

#: tarot_cards.lua:136
msgid "Patience, balance, moderation, harmony"
msgstr "耐心、平衡、适度、和谐"

#: tarot_cards.lua:137
msgid "Sagittarius"
msgstr "射手座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:138
msgid "Patience, gradual"
msgstr "耐心、循序渐进"

#: tarot_cards.lua:139
msgid "Patience. Moderation. Find balance. Water finds its level."
msgstr "耐心。平衡。适度。调和对立，水终会找到自己的水平。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:140
msgid "Excess. Impatience. Disharmony. Return to center, breathe deeply."
msgstr "过度。失衡。缺乏耐心。重新居中，先深呼吸。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:144
msgid "The Devil"
msgstr "恶魔"

#: tarot_cards.lua:145
msgid "Temptation, attachment, shadow, materialism"
msgstr "诱惑、束缚、阴影、物质主义"

#: tarot_cards.lua:146
msgid "Capricorn"
msgstr "摩羯座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:147
msgid "15 days"
msgstr "15 天"

#: tarot_cards.lua:148
msgid ""
"Temptation. Negative patterns. Free yourself from chains. You have the power t"
"o break free."
msgstr "诱惑。束缚。面对自己的阴影。觉察锁链，才能挣脱。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:149
msgid "Liberation. Breaking addictions. Recovery. Light enters where darkness once was."
msgstr "解脱。摆脱束缚。觉知。你开始看清黑暗中的锁链。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:153 tarot_cards.lua:833
msgid "The Tower"
msgstr "高塔"

#: tarot_cards.lua:154
msgid "Revelation, upheaval, chaos, reconstruction"
msgstr "启示、剧变、混乱、重建"

#: tarot_cards.lua:155
msgid "Mars"
msgstr "火星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:156
msgid "Sudden, unexpected"
msgstr "突然、意外"

#: tarot_cards.lua:157
msgid "Sudden revelation. Rupture. Necessary reconstruction. What is false crumbles."
msgstr "突如其来的启示。结构崩塌。虚假的一切倒下，为真相腾出空间。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:158
msgid "Avoiding disaster. Fear of change. Denial. The fall is inevitable, accept it."
msgstr "躲过灾难。害怕改变。延迟不可避免之事。尽早重建。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:162 tarot_cards.lua:812
msgid "The Star"
msgstr "星星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:163
msgid "Hope, faith, inspiration, renewal"
msgstr "希望、信念、灵感、复苏"

#: tarot_cards.lua:164
msgid "Aquarius"
msgstr "水瓶座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:165
msgid "17 days"
msgstr "17 天"

#: tarot_cards.lua:166
msgid ""
"Hope. Faith. Follow your intuition. Light guides you in darkness. Trust the un"
"iverse."
msgstr "希望。信念。灵感。在暴风雨后重新振作，并再次信任宇宙。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:167
msgid ""
"Hopelessness. Lack of faith. Spiritual disconnection. The light is there, you "
"just don't see it."
msgstr "绝望。缺乏信念。与自我失去连接。光仍在那里，请重新寻找。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:171 tarot_cards.lua:924
msgid "The Moon"
msgstr "月亮"

#: tarot_cards.lua:172
msgid "Illusion, intuition, fear, subconscious"
msgstr "幻象、直觉、恐惧、潜意识"

#: tarot_cards.lua:173
msgid "Pisces"
msgstr "双鱼座"

#: tarot_cards.lua:174
msgid "28 days, nocturnal"
msgstr "28 天、夜间"

#: tarot_cards.lua:175
msgid ""
"Illusion. Intuition. Not everything is as it seems. Walk carefully in the twil"
"ight."
msgstr "幻象。深层直觉。潜意识中的恐惧。以觉察穿越朦胧地带。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:176
msgid "Confusion cleared. Fear overcome. Truth revealed. The fog is lifting."
msgstr "困惑逐渐消散。真相浮现。恐惧减弱。迷雾正在散去。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:180 tarot_cards.lua:917
msgid "The Sun"
msgstr "太阳"

#: tarot_cards.lua:181
msgid "Joy, success, vitality, clarity"
msgstr "喜悦、成功、活力、清晰"

#: tarot_cards.lua:182
msgid "Sun"
msgstr "太阳"

#: tarot_cards.lua:183
msgid "19 days, diurnal"
msgstr "19 天、白昼"

#: tarot_cards.lua:184
msgid "Joy. Success. Vitality. Everything is illuminated. Happiness overflows."
msgstr "喜悦。成功。活力。光明照亮一切。分享满溢的幸福。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:185
msgid "Temporary sadness. Delay. Lack of enthusiasm. The sun always shines again."
msgstr "短暂的悲伤。延迟的成功。光线微弱。太阳仍会再次升起。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:189
msgid "Judgement"
msgstr "审判"

#: tarot_cards.lua:190
msgid "Renewal, awakening, forgiveness, calling"
msgstr "更新、觉醒、宽恕、召唤"

#: tarot_cards.lua:191
msgid "Pluto"
msgstr "冥王星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:192
msgid "Renewal, awakening"
msgstr "更新、觉醒"

#: tarot_cards.lua:193
msgid "Renewal. Inner calling. Time to awaken. The past has been forgiven."
msgstr "更新。觉醒。内在召唤。宽恕过去，回应你的使命。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:194
msgid "Self-criticism. Regret. Denial of the calling. Free yourself from guilt."
msgstr "自我批判。拒绝召唤。内疚。释放评判，倾听内心。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:198
msgid "The World"
msgstr "世界"

#: tarot_cards.lua:199
msgid "Completion, fulfillment, integration, success"
msgstr "完成、圆满、整合、成功"

#: tarot_cards.lua:200
msgid "Saturn"
msgstr "土星"

#: tarot_cards.lua:201
msgid "21 days/months, full cycle"
msgstr "21 天或 21 个月、完整周期"

#: tarot_cards.lua:202
msgid ""
"Completion. Fulfillment. Cycle successfully concluded. The universe celebrates"
" with you."
msgstr "完成。圆满。一个周期成功结束。宇宙与你一同庆祝。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:203
msgid "Incompleteness. Delay. Lack of closure. There is still one step to take."
msgstr "尚未完成。延迟。缺乏收尾。还有最后一步要走。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:218
msgid "Ace"
msgstr "王牌"

#: tarot_cards.lua:219
msgid "Two"
msgstr "二"

#: tarot_cards.lua:220
msgid "Three"
msgstr "三"

#: tarot_cards.lua:221
msgid "Four"
msgstr "四"

#: tarot_cards.lua:222
msgid "Five"
msgstr "五"

#: tarot_cards.lua:223
msgid "Six"
msgstr "六"

#: tarot_cards.lua:224
msgid "Seven"
msgstr "七"

#: tarot_cards.lua:225
msgid "Eight"
msgstr "八"

#: tarot_cards.lua:226
msgid "Nine"
msgstr "九"

#: tarot_cards.lua:227
msgid "Ten"
msgstr "十"

#: tarot_cards.lua:228
msgid "Page"
msgstr "侍从"

#: tarot_cards.lua:229
msgid "Knight"
msgstr "骑士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:230
msgid "Queen"
msgstr "王后"

#: tarot_cards.lua:231
msgid "King"
msgstr "国王"

#: tarot_cards.lua:238
msgid "Ace of Wands"
msgstr "权杖王牌"

#: tarot_cards.lua:239
msgid "Inspiration, creativity, new beginning, energy"
msgstr "灵感、创造力、新开始、能量"

#: tarot_cards.lua:240
msgid "Fast (days)"
msgstr "迅速（数日）"

#: tarot_cards.lua:241
msgid ""
"Creative inspiration. A new beginning full of energy. Seize the initial impuls"
"e to start projects."
msgstr "创作灵感。充满能量的新开始。抓住最初的冲动，启动计划。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:242
msgid ""
"False start. Procrastination. Lack of motivation. Rekindle your passion before"
" moving on."
msgstr "起步受挫。拖延。缺乏动力。继续前先重新点燃热情。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:246
msgid "Two of Wands"
msgstr "权杖二"

#: tarot_cards.lua:247
msgid "Planning, vision, decision, expansion"
msgstr "规划、愿景、决定、扩展"

#: tarot_cards.lua:248
msgid "Weeks"
msgstr "数周"

#: tarot_cards.lua:249
msgid ""
"Planning. Looking ahead. You have the world in your hands, but you must choose"
" the path."
msgstr "规划。展望未来。世界已在你手中，但你必须选择道路。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:250
msgid ""
"Fear of the unknown. Lack of planning. Letting go of the reins. Define your go"
"als."
msgstr "害怕未知。缺乏规划。放弃掌控。明确你的目标。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:254
msgid "Three of Wands"
msgstr "权杖三"

#: tarot_cards.lua:255
msgid "Expansion, progress, anticipation, trade"
msgstr "扩展、进展、期待、贸易"

#: tarot_cards.lua:256
msgid "Soon"
msgstr "不久"

#: tarot_cards.lua:257
msgid ""
"Expansion. Progress. Your plans are sailing. Await the return of the seeds you"
" planted."
msgstr "扩展。进展。你的计划已经启航。等待自己播下的种子带来回报。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:258
msgid "Unexpected obstacles. Delay. Frustration with results. Reassess your strategy."
msgstr "意外阻碍。延迟。对结果感到挫败。重新评估策略。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:262
msgid "Four of Wands"
msgstr "权杖四"

#: tarot_cards.lua:263
msgid "Celebration, home, harmony, stability"
msgstr "庆祝、家庭、和谐、稳定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:264
msgid "4 weeks"
msgstr "4 周"

#: tarot_cards.lua:265
msgid ""
"Celebration. Harmony at home. Shared achievements. A well-deserved rest after "
"effort."
msgstr "庆祝。家庭和睦。共同取得成就。努力之后获得应有的休息。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:266
msgid "Lack of unity. Domestic instability. Postponed celebration. Recover simple joy."
msgstr "缺乏团结。家庭不稳。庆祝推迟。重新找回简单的快乐。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:270
msgid "Five of Wands"
msgstr "权杖五"

#: tarot_cards.lua:271
msgid "Competition, conflict, debate, growth"
msgstr "竞争、冲突、辩论、成长"

#: tarot_cards.lua:272
msgid "5 weeks"
msgstr "5 周"

#: tarot_cards.lua:273
msgid "Healthy competition. Creative conflict. Different viewpoints enrich the search."
msgstr "良性竞争。创造性的冲突。不同观点让探索更加丰富。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:274
msgid ""
"Internal quarrels. Avoiding confrontation. Energy drain. Seek cooperation inst"
"ead of dispute."
msgstr "内部争执。逃避对抗。精力耗损。以合作取代争斗。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:278
msgid "Six of Wands"
msgstr "权杖六"

#: tarot_cards.lua:279
msgid "Victory, recognition, triumph, confidence"
msgstr "胜利、认可、凯旋、自信"

#: tarot_cards.lua:280
msgid "6 weeks"
msgstr "6 周"

#: tarot_cards.lua:281
msgid "Victory. Public recognition. High self-esteem. Reap the laurels with humility."
msgstr "胜利。获得公众认可。自尊高涨。谦逊地接受荣誉。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:282
msgid "Inflated ego. Short-lived recognition. Envy. True victory is internal."
msgstr "自我膨胀。短暂的认可。嫉妒。真正的胜利来自内心。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:286
msgid "Seven of Wands"
msgstr "权杖七"

#: tarot_cards.lua:287
msgid "Defense, perseverance, courage, resistance"
msgstr "防守、坚持、勇气、抵抗"

#: tarot_cards.lua:289
msgid ""
"Defense of positions. Perseverance. Stand firm despite opposition. You have th"
"e upper hand."
msgstr "捍卫立场。坚持不懈。即使面对反对也要站稳脚跟，你仍占据优势。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:290
msgid "Exhaustion. Feeling cornered. Giving up. Reinforce your boundaries wisely."
msgstr "筋疲力尽。感觉被逼入绝境。放弃。明智地巩固自己的界限。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:294
msgid "Eight of Wands"
msgstr "权杖八"

#: tarot_cards.lua:295
msgid "Speed, action, progress, communication"
msgstr "速度、行动、进展、沟通"

#: tarot_cards.lua:296
msgid "Very fast"
msgstr "非常迅速"

#: tarot_cards.lua:297
msgid ""
"Swift movement. News arriving. Accelerated action. Take advantage of the tailw"
"ind."
msgstr "快速推进。消息传来。行动加速。善用顺风之势。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:298
msgid "Delay. Lack of direction. Scattered energy. Wait for the right moment to act."
msgstr "延迟。缺乏方向。精力分散。等待合适的行动时机。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:302
msgid "Nine of Wands"
msgstr "权杖九"

#: tarot_cards.lua:303
msgid "Resilience, persistence, last stand, fatigue"
msgstr "韧性、坚持、最后坚守、疲惫"

#: tarot_cards.lua:304
msgid "9 weeks"
msgstr "9 周"

#: tarot_cards.lua:305
msgid ""
"Resilience. Last battle. You are almost there, even if tired. Keep your guard "
"up."
msgstr "韧性。最后一战。即使疲惫，你也已接近终点。继续保持警觉。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:306
msgid ""
"Stubbornness. Refusing help. Exhaustion. Let down your defense and allow yours"
"elf to rest."
msgstr "固执。拒绝帮助。精疲力竭。卸下防备，让自己休息。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:310
msgid "Ten of Wands"
msgstr "权杖十"

#: tarot_cards.lua:311
msgid "Overload, responsibility, burden, effort"
msgstr "超负荷、责任、重担、努力"

#: tarot_cards.lua:312
msgid "10 weeks, end of cycle"
msgstr "10 周、周期末尾"

#: tarot_cards.lua:313
msgid ""
"Overload. Heavy responsibilities. The burden is great, but the end is near. De"
"legate tasks."
msgstr "负担过重。责任沉重。担子虽重，但终点已近。把任务分担出去。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:314
msgid ""
"Inability to delegate. Burnout. Refusing help. Let go of what doesn't belong t"
"o you."
msgstr "无法放权。身心耗竭。拒绝帮助。放下不属于你的责任。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:318
msgid "Page of Wands"
msgstr "权杖侍从"

#: tarot_cards.lua:319
msgid "Enthusiasm, exploration, discovery, new idea"
msgstr "热情、探索、发现、新想法"

#: tarot_cards.lua:320
msgid "Youthful, fast"
msgstr "年轻、迅速"

#: tarot_cards.lua:321
msgid ""
"Enthusiasm. New ideas. A young messenger brings inspiration. Explore your curi"
"osity without fear."
msgstr "热情。新想法。一位年轻的信使带来灵感。无惧地探索你的好奇心。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:322
msgid "Lack of plans. Impulsiveness. Ideas without execution. Set goals before acting."
msgstr "缺乏计划。冲动。想法没有落实。行动前先设定目标。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:326
msgid "Knight of Wands"
msgstr "权杖骑士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:327
msgid "Action, passion, impulse, adventure"
msgstr "行动、热情、冲动、冒险"

#: tarot_cards.lua:328
msgid "Immediate, intense"
msgstr "立即、强烈"

#: tarot_cards.lua:329
msgid ""
"Passionate action. Courage to take risks. Go ahead boldly, but don't forget th"
"e destination."
msgstr "充满热情地行动。敢于冒险。大胆前进，但别忘记目的地。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:330
msgid ""
"Impatience. Rushing without direction. Conflict. Slow down and choose the righ"
"t path."
msgstr "急躁。没有方向地猛冲。冲突。放慢脚步，选择正确道路。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:334
msgid "Queen of Wands"
msgstr "权杖王后"

#: tarot_cards.lua:335
msgid "Charisma, leadership, warmth, confidence"
msgstr "魅力、领导力、温暖、自信"

#: tarot_cards.lua:336
msgid "Summer, mature"
msgstr "夏季、成熟"

#: tarot_cards.lua:337
msgid ""
"Warmth, determination and magnetism. Inspiring leadership. Use your charisma t"
"o attract what you want."
msgstr "温暖、坚定且富有吸引力。鼓舞人心的领导力。用你的魅力吸引所求之物。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:338
msgid "Jealousy. Insecurity. Explosive temper. The inner flame can burn those nearby."
msgstr "嫉妒。不安。脾气暴烈。内在火焰也可能灼伤身边的人。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:342
msgid "King of Wands"
msgstr "权杖国王"

#: tarot_cards.lua:343
msgid "Vision, entrepreneurship, authority, honor"
msgstr "愿景、创业精神、权威、荣誉"

#: tarot_cards.lua:344
msgid "Long term, leadership"
msgstr "长期、领导"

#: tarot_cards.lua:345
msgid ""
"Entrepreneurial vision. Strong leadership. Take command with integrity and ins"
"pire others."
msgstr "创业愿景。强大的领导力。以正直掌舵，并激励他人。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:346
msgid ""
"Authoritarianism. Empty promises. Lack of vision. Leading by fear builds nothi"
"ng lasting."
msgstr "专制。空洞承诺。缺乏远见。靠恐惧领导，无法建立长久之物。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:352
msgid "Ace of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯王牌"

#: tarot_cards.lua:353
msgid "Love, emotion, intuition, new feeling"
msgstr "爱、情感、直觉、新感受"

#: tarot_cards.lua:354
msgid "Lunar, emotional"
msgstr "月亮周期、情感"

#: tarot_cards.lua:355
msgid ""
"Overflowing love. New emotional cycle. Open yourself to deep feelings and true"
" connections."
msgstr "爱意满溢。新的情感周期。向深厚的感受与真挚的连接敞开心扉。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:356
msgid ""
"Repressed love. Emotional block. Inner emptiness. Allow yourself to feel in or"
"der to heal."
msgstr "压抑的爱。情感阻塞。内在空虚。允许自己感受，才能疗愈。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:360
msgid "Two of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯二"

#: tarot_cards.lua:361
msgid "Union, partnership, commitment, attraction"
msgstr "结合、伙伴关系、承诺、吸引"

#: tarot_cards.lua:362
msgid "Meeting soon"
msgstr "不久后相遇"

#: tarot_cards.lua:363
msgid ""
"Union. Loving partnership. Soul meeting. Mutual respect and commitment strengt"
"hen the bond."
msgstr "结合。充满爱意的伙伴关系。灵魂相遇。相互尊重与承诺会巩固纽带。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:364
msgid ""
"Disconnection. Quarrels. Emotional imbalance. A sincere conversation can resto"
"re harmony."
msgstr "失去连接。争吵。情感失衡。真诚的交谈可以恢复和谐。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:368
msgid "Three of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯三"

#: tarot_cards.lua:369
msgid "Friendship, celebration, community, joy"
msgstr "友谊、庆祝、社群、喜悦"

#: tarot_cards.lua:370
msgid "Social event"
msgstr "社交活动"

#: tarot_cards.lua:371
msgid ""
"Friendship. Celebration. Shared joy. Gather with those you love and celebrate "
"life."
msgstr "友谊。庆祝。共享喜悦。与所爱之人相聚，庆祝生活。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:372
msgid ""
"Gossip. Isolation. Excess partying. Beware of superficial friendships and hidd"
"en resentments."
msgstr "流言蜚语。孤立。聚会过度。警惕肤浅的友谊与隐藏的怨恨。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:376
msgid "Four of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯四"

#: tarot_cards.lua:377
msgid "Contemplation, apathy, boredom, introspection"
msgstr "沉思、冷漠、厌倦、内省"

#: tarot_cards.lua:378
msgid "Stagnant"
msgstr "停滞"

#: tarot_cards.lua:379
msgid ""
"Contemplation. Apathy. New invitation ignored. Look beyond boredom to notice o"
"pportunities."
msgstr "沉思。冷漠。忽视新的邀请。越过厌倦，留意身边的机会。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:380
msgid ""
"Awakening. Acceptance. New perspectives. Leave your comfort zone and seize the"
" chance offered."
msgstr "觉醒。接纳。新的视角。走出舒适区，抓住所提供的机会。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:384
msgid "Five of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯五"

#: tarot_cards.lua:385
msgid "Grief, loss, regret, focus on negative"
msgstr "悲伤、失去、遗憾、关注消极面"

#: tarot_cards.lua:386
msgid "Recent past"
msgstr "不久前"

#: tarot_cards.lua:387
msgid "Grief. Loss. Focus on what is gone. Two cups still stand – look at what remains."
msgstr "悲伤。失去。只关注已经离去的事物。仍有两只圣杯立着——看看你还拥有什么。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:388
msgid "Overcoming. Recovery. Learning from pain. Accept the past and move forward."
msgstr "克服困难。恢复。从痛苦中学习。接受过去，继续前行。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:392
msgid "Six of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯六"

#: tarot_cards.lua:393
msgid "Nostalgia, memory, childhood, gift"
msgstr "怀旧、回忆、童年、礼物"

#: tarot_cards.lua:394
msgid "Revisiting the past"
msgstr "重访过去"

#: tarot_cards.lua:395
msgid ""
"Nostalgia. Fond memories. Reunion with the past. Cherish your roots with affec"
"tion."
msgstr "怀旧。温馨的回忆。与过去重逢。怀着爱珍视自己的根源。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:396
msgid "Clinging to the past. Immaturity. Inability to move on. Live the present."
msgstr "执着于过去。不成熟。无法继续前进。活在当下。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:400
msgid "Seven of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯七"

#: tarot_cards.lua:401
msgid "Illusion, choices, fantasy, dreams"
msgstr "幻象、选择、幻想、梦想"

#: tarot_cards.lua:402
msgid "Confusing, indefinite"
msgstr "混乱、时间不定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:403
msgid ""
"Illusions. Fantasies. Multiple options. Discernment is needed to choose the tr"
"ue cup."
msgstr "幻象。幻想。多种选择。需要辨别力，才能选出真实的那只圣杯。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:404
msgid "Clarity. Firm decision. End of illusions. Focus on what really matters."
msgstr "清晰。坚定决定。幻象终结。专注于真正重要的事。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:408
msgid "Eight of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯八"

#: tarot_cards.lua:409
msgid "Withdrawal, search, disillusion, departure"
msgstr "离开、追寻、幻灭、启程"

#: tarot_cards.lua:410
msgid "Emotional transition"
msgstr "情感过渡"

#: tarot_cards.lua:411
msgid ""
"Withdrawal. Spiritual search. Leaving behind what doesn't fulfill. Follow your"
" intuition."
msgstr "离开。精神追寻。把无法带来满足的事物留在身后。跟随直觉。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:412
msgid ""
"Fear of change. Staying out of convenience. Silent dissatisfaction. Courage to"
" leave."
msgstr "害怕改变。因贪图方便而留下。默默不满。鼓起离开的勇气。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:416
msgid "Nine of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯九"

#: tarot_cards.lua:417
msgid "Wish fulfilled, satisfaction, contentment, luxury"
msgstr "愿望实现、满足、知足、享受"

#: tarot_cards.lua:418
msgid "Soon fulfillment"
msgstr "愿望即将实现"

#: tarot_cards.lua:419
msgid ""
"Wish fulfilled. Satisfaction. The “dream cup” is full. Enjoy emotional abundan"
"ce."
msgstr "愿望实现。满足。“梦想之杯”已经盛满。享受情感上的丰盛。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:420
msgid ""
"Dissatisfaction. Unmet desires. Empty materialism. True happiness lies in simp"
"licity."
msgstr "不满。愿望未遂。空洞的物质主义。真正的幸福在于简单。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:424
msgid "Ten of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯十"

#: tarot_cards.lua:425
msgid "Happiness, family, harmony, blessing"
msgstr "幸福、家庭、和谐、祝福"

#: tarot_cards.lua:426
msgid "Happy ending"
msgstr "圆满结局"

#: tarot_cards.lua:427
msgid ""
"Full happiness. Family love. Lasting harmony. The heart overflows with shared "
"joy."
msgstr "圆满幸福。家人之爱。长久和谐。内心洋溢着共同的喜悦。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:428
msgid ""
"Family conflicts. Broken bonds. Idealization of happiness. Work on emotional c"
"ommunication."
msgstr "家庭冲突。纽带破裂。理想化幸福。改善情感沟通。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:432
msgid "Page of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯侍从"

#: tarot_cards.lua:433
msgid "Sensitivity, creativity, message, intuition"
msgstr "敏感、创造力、消息、直觉"

#: tarot_cards.lua:434
msgid "Emotional surprise"
msgstr "情感上的惊喜"

#: tarot_cards.lua:435
msgid "Creative sensitivity. Message of love. Open up to intuition and heart surprises."
msgstr "富有创造力的敏感。爱的讯息。向直觉与内心的惊喜敞开。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:436
msgid ""
"Emotional immaturity. Love disappointment. Childish jealousy. Put fantasy asid"
"e and face reality."
msgstr "情感不成熟。爱情失望。幼稚的嫉妒。放下幻想，面对现实。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:440
msgid "Knight of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯骑士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:441
msgid "Romanticism, charm, proposal, idealism"
msgstr "浪漫、魅力、提议、理想主义"

#: tarot_cards.lua:442
msgid "Invitation soon"
msgstr "邀请即将到来"

#: tarot_cards.lua:443
msgid ""
"Romanticism. Charming proposal. Search for the beautiful and ideal. Follow you"
"r heart with elegance."
msgstr "浪漫。迷人的提议。追寻美与理想。优雅地跟随内心。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:444
msgid ""
"Love illusion. Empty promises. Excess of idealization. Keep your feet on the g"
"round."
msgstr "爱情幻象。空洞承诺。过度理想化。保持脚踏实地。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:448
msgid "Queen of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯王后"

#: tarot_cards.lua:449
msgid "Empathy, intuition, care, compassion"
msgstr "共情、直觉、关怀、慈悲"

#: tarot_cards.lua:450
msgid "Lunar cycle, mature"
msgstr "月亮周期、成熟"

#: tarot_cards.lua:451
msgid ""
"Deep intuition. Empathy. Emotional caregiver. Trust your ability to love and h"
"eal."
msgstr "深刻直觉。共情。情感上的照料者。相信自己爱与疗愈的能力。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:452
msgid ""
"Emotional dependence. Exacerbated sensitivity. Emotional manipulation. Set hea"
"lthy boundaries."
msgstr "情感依赖。过度敏感。情感操控。设立健康的界限。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:456
msgid "King of Cups"
msgstr "圣杯国王"

#: tarot_cards.lua:457
msgid "Emotional mastery, diplomacy, calm, wisdom"
msgstr "情感掌控、外交、平静、智慧"

#: tarot_cards.lua:458
msgid "Emotional stability"
msgstr "情感稳定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:459
msgid ""
"Emotional mastery. Mature compassion. Leadership with heart. Calm turbulent wa"
"ters with wisdom."
msgstr "成熟地掌控情感。深厚的慈悲。以真心领导。用智慧平息汹涌波涛。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:460
msgid ""
"Coldness. Emotional repression. Manipulation. The repressed heart becomes a si"
"lent tyrant."
msgstr "冷漠。压抑情感。操控。受压抑的心会成为沉默的暴君。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:466
msgid "Ace of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑王牌"

#: tarot_cards.lua:467
msgid "Clarity, truth, justice, sharp mind"
msgstr "清晰、真相、正义、敏锐思维"

#: tarot_cards.lua:468
msgid "Quick decision"
msgstr "迅速作出决定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:469
msgid ""
"Mental clarity. Truth revealed. Sharp idea. Use the power of the word with jus"
"tice."
msgstr "思维清晰。真相揭示。敏锐的想法。公正地运用语言的力量。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:470
msgid "Confusion. Lies. Verbal abuse. Distorted truth hurts. Seek clean communication."
msgstr "困惑。谎言。言语伤害。被扭曲的真相会伤人。寻求清楚坦诚的沟通。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:474
msgid "Two of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑二"

#: tarot_cards.lua:475
msgid "Impasse, difficult choice, denial, balance"
msgstr "僵局、艰难选择、否认、平衡"

#: tarot_cards.lua:476
msgid "Stalled"
msgstr "停滞不前"

#: tarot_cards.lua:477
msgid ""
"Difficult decision. Impasse. Precarious balance. Remove the blindfold and face"
" the situation."
msgstr "艰难的决定。僵局。脆弱的平衡。摘下眼罩，直面处境。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:478
msgid ""
"Postponed decision. Escape from truth. Internal conflict. Free yourself from p"
"aralysis and choose."
msgstr "推迟决定。逃避真相。内心冲突。摆脱瘫痪状态，作出选择。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:482
msgid "Three of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑三"

#: tarot_cards.lua:483
msgid "Pain, betrayal, sadness, heartbreak"
msgstr "痛苦、背叛、悲伤、心碎"

#: tarot_cards.lua:484
msgid "Recent pain"
msgstr "近期的痛苦"

#: tarot_cards.lua:485
msgid ""
"Emotional pain. Betrayal. Broken heart. Suffering is real, but it's the first "
"step toward healing."
msgstr "情感创伤。背叛。心碎。痛苦真实存在，但它是走向疗愈的第一步。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:486
msgid ""
"Slow recovery. Holding grudges. Difficulty forgiving. Free yourself from the p"
"oison of resentment."
msgstr "恢复缓慢。心怀怨恨。难以原谅。让自己摆脱怨恨的毒害。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:490
msgid "Four of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑四"

#: tarot_cards.lua:491
msgid "Rest, recovery, contemplation, pause"
msgstr "休息、恢复、沉思、暂停"

#: tarot_cards.lua:492
msgid "Necessary pause"
msgstr "必要的暂停"

#: tarot_cards.lua:493
msgid "Mental rest. Retreat. Recovery. Step away from the noise and recharge your mind."
msgstr "让思绪休息。退隐。恢复。远离喧嚣，为心智补充能量。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:494
msgid ""
"Insomnia. Mental exhaustion. Inability to relax. Excessive thinking makes you "
"sick."
msgstr "失眠。精神疲惫。无法放松。过度思虑会损害健康。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:498
msgid "Five of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑五"

#: tarot_cards.lua:499
msgid "Conflict, defeat, hostility, hollow victory"
msgstr "冲突、失败、敌意、空洞的胜利"

#: tarot_cards.lua:500
msgid "Current conflict"
msgstr "当前的冲突"

#: tarot_cards.lua:501
msgid ""
"Conflict. Empty victory. Humiliation. Sometimes winning the battle means losin"
"g the war."
msgstr "冲突。空洞的胜利。羞辱。有时赢得战斗却意味着输掉战争。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:502
msgid "Reconciliation. Remorse. Putting pride aside. Seek peace instead of being right."
msgstr "和解。悔意。放下自尊。寻求和平，而不是执着于证明自己正确。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:506
msgid "Six of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑六"

#: tarot_cards.lua:507
msgid "Transition, healing, journey, moving on"
msgstr "过渡、疗愈、旅程、继续前行"

#: tarot_cards.lua:508
msgid "Gradual transition"
msgstr "逐步过渡"

#: tarot_cards.lua:509
msgid ""
"Smooth transition. Healing journey. Leaving turbulent waters behind. Toward ca"
"lm waters."
msgstr "平稳过渡。疗愈之旅。把汹涌水域留在身后，驶向平静。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:510
msgid ""
"Resistance to change. Emotional baggage. Staying stuck in the problem. Release"
" what you cannot carry."
msgstr "抗拒改变。背负情感包袱。困在问题中。放下你无法继续携带的东西。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:514
msgid "Seven of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑七"

#: tarot_cards.lua:515
msgid "Strategy, deception, escape, cunning"
msgstr "策略、欺骗、逃避、机敏"

#: tarot_cards.lua:516
msgid "Fast, stealthy"
msgstr "迅速、隐秘"

#: tarot_cards.lua:517
msgid ""
"Strategy. Subtle escape. Not everything needs to be faced head-on. Act with in"
"telligence."
msgstr "策略。巧妙脱身。并非所有事情都需要正面迎击。以智慧行事。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:518
msgid "Deception. Theft. Lack of ethics. Lies have short legs. Act with honesty."
msgstr "欺骗。偷窃。缺乏道德。谎言很快就会露馅。诚实行事。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:522
msgid "Eight of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑八"

#: tarot_cards.lua:523
msgid "Imprisonment, self-sabotage, limitation, fear"
msgstr "囚禁、自我破坏、限制、恐惧"

#: tarot_cards.lua:524
msgid "Mental prison, temporary"
msgstr "心灵牢笼、暂时"

#: tarot_cards.lua:525
msgid ""
"Feeling trapped. Self-sabotage. Imaginary limitations. The prison is mental – "
"the key is within you."
msgstr "感觉受困。自我破坏。想象出来的限制。牢笼在心中——钥匙也在你手里。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:526
msgid ""
"Liberation. New perspective. Overcoming limiting beliefs. Break the bonds and "
"see the light."
msgstr "解脱。新的视角。克服限制性信念。挣脱束缚，看见光明。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:530
msgid "Nine of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑九"

#: tarot_cards.lua:531
msgid "Anxiety, nightmare, worry, anguish"
msgstr "焦虑、噩梦、担忧、痛苦"

#: tarot_cards.lua:532
msgid "Nocturnal, insomnia"
msgstr "夜间、失眠"

#: tarot_cards.lua:533
msgid ""
"Anxiety. Nightmares. Nocturnal worries. The mind is its own tormentor. Seek to"
" calm your thoughts."
msgstr "焦虑。噩梦。夜间忧虑。心智会成为自己的折磨者。设法平静思绪。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:534
msgid ""
"Recovery from anguish. Learning from pain. The worst is over. Take a deep brea"
"th."
msgstr "从痛苦中恢复。从伤痛中学习。最糟的已经过去。深呼吸。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:538
msgid "Ten of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑十"

#: tarot_cards.lua:539
msgid "Painful ending, betrayal, crisis, rebirth"
msgstr "痛苦的结束、背叛、危机、重生"

#: tarot_cards.lua:540
msgid "Rock bottom, new dawn"
msgstr "跌至谷底、新的黎明"

#: tarot_cards.lua:541
msgid ""
"Painful ending. Final betrayal. Rock bottom. From this abyss one can only rise"
" – dawn arrives."
msgstr "痛苦的结束。最终的背叛。跌至谷底。从深渊中只能向上——黎明终会到来。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:542
msgid ""
"Recovery. Resistance. Avoiding the final collapse. Suffering can be transforme"
"d into strength."
msgstr "恢复。抵抗。避免彻底崩溃。痛苦可以转化为力量。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:546
msgid "Page of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑侍从"

#: tarot_cards.lua:547
msgid "Curiosity, communication, ideas, vigilance"
msgstr "好奇、沟通、想法、警觉"

#: tarot_cards.lua:548
msgid "News shortly"
msgstr "消息即将到来"

#: tarot_cards.lua:549
msgid ""
"Intellectual curiosity. New ideas. Agile communication. Speak your truth, but "
"with tact."
msgstr "求知的好奇心。新想法。敏捷沟通。说出真相，但要注意分寸。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:550
msgid ""
"Gossip. Superficial thinking. Baseless criticism. Use your mind to build, not "
"destroy."
msgstr "流言蜚语。思考肤浅。毫无根据的批评。用头脑去建设，而非摧毁。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:554
msgid "Knight of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑骑士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:555
msgid "Swift action, impulse, determination, conflict"
msgstr "迅速行动、冲动、决心、冲突"

#: tarot_cards.lua:556
msgid "Now, urgent"
msgstr "现在、紧迫"

#: tarot_cards.lua:557
msgid ""
"Impetuous action. Intellectual determination. Advance with momentum, but don't"
" trample others."
msgstr "果断迅猛地行动。理智上的决心。乘势前进，但不要践踏他人。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:558
msgid ""
"Blind impulsiveness. Unnecessary confrontation. Aggressiveness. Think before b"
"randishing the sword."
msgstr "盲目冲动。不必要的对抗。攻击性。挥剑前先思考。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:562
msgid "Queen of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑王后"

#: tarot_cards.lua:563
msgid "Rationality, independence, discernment, truth"
msgstr "理性、独立、辨别力、真相"

#: tarot_cards.lua:564
msgid "Mature decision"
msgstr "成熟的决定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:565
msgid ""
"Clear rationality. Independence. Weighted justice. Make decisions with the min"
"d, but without losing empathy."
msgstr "清醒的理性。独立。审慎的正义。用头脑作决定，但不要失去共情。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:566
msgid ""
"Emotional coldness. Bitterness. Harsh judgment. Reason without heart becomes c"
"ruelty."
msgstr "情感冷漠。苦涩。苛刻评判。没有温度的理性会变成残酷。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:570
msgid "King of Swords"
msgstr "宝剑国王"

#: tarot_cards.lua:571
msgid "Intellectual authority, ethics, clarity, justice"
msgstr "思想权威、道德、清晰、正义"

#: tarot_cards.lua:572
msgid "Legal authority, long term"
msgstr "法律权威、长期"

#: tarot_cards.lua:573
msgid ""
"Intellectual authority. Ethics. Just and lucid leadership. Truth is your sharp"
"est sword."
msgstr "思想权威。道德。公正而清醒的领导力。真相是你最锋利的剑。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:574
msgid ""
"Mental tyranny. Manipulation of truth. Abuse of power. Intellect without moral"
"s oppresses."
msgstr "思想专制。操弄真相。滥用权力。没有道德的才智会造成压迫。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:580
msgid "Ace of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币王牌"

#: tarot_cards.lua:581
msgid "Opportunity, prosperity, new resource, security"
msgstr "机会、繁荣、新资源、安全"

#: tarot_cards.lua:582
msgid "Material beginning"
msgstr "物质层面的开始"

#: tarot_cards.lua:583
msgid "New material opportunity. Prosperity at hand. Get to work to reap solid fruits."
msgstr "新的物质机会。繁荣近在眼前。着手行动，收获坚实成果。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:584
msgid ""
"Missed opportunity. Greed. Financial delay. The foundation needs to be set bef"
"ore growing."
msgstr "错失机会。贪婪。财务延迟。成长之前，必须先打好基础。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:588
msgid "Two of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币二"

#: tarot_cards.lua:589
msgid "Balance, adaptation, juggling, priorities"
msgstr "平衡、适应、兼顾、优先次序"

#: tarot_cards.lua:590
msgid "Fluctuating"
msgstr "起伏不定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:591
msgid ""
"Financial balance. Juggling. Adapt to changes without losing control of your a"
"ccounts."
msgstr "财务平衡。多方兼顾。适应变化，同时不失去对账目的掌控。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:592
msgid ""
"Disorganization. Debt overload. Inability to prioritize. Reorganize your finan"
"ces."
msgstr "混乱无序。债务过重。无法分清轻重缓急。重新整理财务。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:596
msgid "Three of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币三"

#: tarot_cards.lua:597
msgid "Teamwork, collaboration, mastery, skill"
msgstr "团队合作、协作、精通、技能"

#: tarot_cards.lua:598
msgid "Project in progress"
msgstr "项目进行中"

#: tarot_cards.lua:599
msgid ""
"Teamwork. Mastery. Productive collaboration. Together, the result is greater t"
"han the sum."
msgstr "团队合作。精湛技艺。富有成效的协作。众人合作的成果大于简单相加。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:600
msgid ""
"Lack of collaboration. Carelessness. Poor workmanship. Restore respect for exc"
"ellence."
msgstr "缺乏协作。粗心。做工低劣。重新尊重卓越品质。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:604
msgid "Four of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币四"

#: tarot_cards.lua:605
msgid "Security, attachment, saving, control"
msgstr "安全、执着、储蓄、控制"

#: tarot_cards.lua:606
msgid "Stable, stagnant"
msgstr "稳定、停滞"

#: tarot_cards.lua:607
msgid ""
"Material security. Attachment to possessions. Healthy saving, but without clos"
"ing off to the new."
msgstr "物质安全。依恋财物。适度储蓄，但不要因此拒绝新事物。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:608
msgid ""
"Miserliness. Fear of loss. Blocking abundance. Let go a little control to rece"
"ive."
msgstr "吝啬。害怕失去。阻断丰盛。稍微放下控制，才能接纳所得。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:612
msgid "Five of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币五"

#: tarot_cards.lua:613
msgid "Hardship, scarcity, exclusion, aid"
msgstr "困境、匮乏、排斥、援助"

#: tarot_cards.lua:614
msgid "Difficult period"
msgstr "困难时期"

#: tarot_cards.lua:615
msgid ""
"Material hardship. Feeling of exclusion. Help is closer than you think. Ask fo"
"r assistance."
msgstr "物质困境。感觉遭到排斥。帮助比你想象的更近。主动求助。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:616
msgid ""
"Financial recovery. End of scarcity. Re-inclusion. Light shines at the end of "
"the tunnel."
msgstr "财务复苏。匮乏结束。重新融入。隧道尽头已有光亮。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:620
msgid "Six of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币六"

#: tarot_cards.lua:621
msgid "Generosity, sharing, charity, balance"
msgstr "慷慨、分享、慈善、平衡"

#: tarot_cards.lua:622
msgid "Give and receive"
msgstr "给予与接受"

#: tarot_cards.lua:623
msgid ""
"Generosity. Sharing. Giving and receiving in balance. Prosperity circulates wh"
"en the hand opens."
msgstr "慷慨。分享。平衡地给予和接受。手掌张开时，财富才能流动。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:624
msgid ""
"Self-interested charity. Debts. Imbalance in giving. Beware of those who only "
"ask and never give back."
msgstr "带有私心的慈善。债务。付出失衡。提防只索取、从不回报的人。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:628
msgid "Seven of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币七"

#: tarot_cards.lua:629
msgid "Patience, harvest, evaluation, investment"
msgstr "耐心、收获、评估、投资"

#: tarot_cards.lua:630
msgid "Long term"
msgstr "长期"

#: tarot_cards.lua:631
msgid ""
"Patience. Harvest in progress. Evaluate if your efforts are yielding the expec"
"ted fruits."
msgstr "耐心。收获正在形成。评估你的努力是否正结出预期的果实。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:632
msgid ""
"Impatience. Fruitless work. Frustration with results. Recalculate the route an"
"d continue."
msgstr "急躁。徒劳的工作。对结果失望。重新规划路线，然后继续。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:636 main.lua:419
msgid "Eight of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币八"

#: tarot_cards.lua:637
msgid "Dedication, learning, improvement, work"
msgstr "投入、学习、精进、工作"

#: tarot_cards.lua:638
msgid "Daily, constant"
msgstr "每日、持续"

#: tarot_cards.lua:639
msgid ""
"Dedicated learning. Craftsmanship. Constant improvement. Mastery requires dail"
"y practice."
msgstr "专心学习。精湛手艺。持续改进。熟练来自每日练习。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:640
msgid ""
"Perfectionism. Monotonous work. Lack of motivation. Rekindle the pleasure in d"
"oing."
msgstr "完美主义。工作单调。缺乏动力。重新找回做事的乐趣。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:644
msgid "Nine of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币九"

#: tarot_cards.lua:645
msgid "Self-sufficiency, luxury, achievement, independence"
msgstr "自给自足、享受、成就、独立"

#: tarot_cards.lua:646
msgid "Personal harvest"
msgstr "个人收获"

#: tarot_cards.lua:647
msgid ""
"Self-sufficiency. Personal luxury. Material achievement with independence. Enj"
"oy what you have built."
msgstr "自给自足。个人享受。独立取得物质成就。享受自己建立的一切。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:648
msgid ""
"Financial dependence. Empty ostentation. Material insecurity. Real value lies "
"in who you are."
msgstr "经济依赖。空洞炫耀。物质上的不安全感。真正的价值在于你是谁。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:652
msgid "Ten of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币十"

#: tarot_cards.lua:653
msgid "Wealth, legacy, family, stability"
msgstr "财富、传承、家庭、稳定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:654
msgid "Permanent, long term"
msgstr "持久、长期"

#: tarot_cards.lua:655
msgid ""
"Lasting wealth. Family legacy. Material and emotional security. Strong roots n"
"ourish the future."
msgstr "持久财富。家庭传承。物质与情感上的安全。深厚根基滋养未来。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:656
msgid ""
"Loss of inheritance. Family conflicts over money. Financial instability. Rebui"
"ld the foundations."
msgstr "失去遗产。家庭因金钱发生冲突。财务不稳。重建基础。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:660
msgid "Page of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币侍从"

#: tarot_cards.lua:661
msgid "Study, ambition, focus, new project"
msgstr "学习、抱负、专注、新项目"

#: tarot_cards.lua:662
msgid "Slow start"
msgstr "缓慢起步"

#: tarot_cards.lua:663
msgid "Applied study. New skill. Constructive ambition. Start small, dream big."
msgstr "用心学习。新技能。建设性的抱负。从小处着手，怀抱远大梦想。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:664
msgid ""
"Lack of focus. Slow progress. Premature abandonment. Persist in studies and wo"
"rk."
msgstr "缺乏专注。进展缓慢。过早放弃。在学习和工作中坚持下去。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:668
msgid "Knight of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币骑士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:669
msgid "Hard work, routine, patience, reliability"
msgstr "勤奋、日常、耐心、可靠"

#: tarot_cards.lua:670
msgid "Step by step"
msgstr "一步一步"

#: tarot_cards.lua:671
msgid "Hard work. Reliable routine. Patience to build. Steady steps take you far."
msgstr "勤奋工作。可靠的日常节奏。耐心建设。稳健的步伐能带你走得很远。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:672
msgid "Stagnation. Boredom. Lack of ambition. Move before inertia becomes permanent."
msgstr "停滞。厌倦。缺乏抱负。在惰性变成常态前行动起来。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:676
msgid "Queen of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币王后"

#: tarot_cards.lua:677
msgid "Prosperity, practical care, home, security"
msgstr "繁荣、务实关怀、家庭、安全"

#: tarot_cards.lua:678
msgid "Domestic cycle"
msgstr "家庭周期"

#: tarot_cards.lua:679
msgid ""
"Homely prosperity. Practical care. Generous mother. Your material security sus"
"tains those you love."
msgstr "家庭兴旺。务实的关怀。慷慨的母亲。你的物质保障支撑着所爱之人。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:680
msgid ""
"Neglect of home. Selfish materialism. Work-home imbalance. Take care of your n"
"est first."
msgstr "忽视家庭。自私的物质主义。工作与家庭失衡。先照料好自己的家。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:684
msgid "King of Pentacles"
msgstr "星币国王"

#: tarot_cards.lua:685
msgid "Success, abundance, stability, business"
msgstr "成功、丰盛、稳定、商业"

#: tarot_cards.lua:686
msgid "Financial maturity"
msgstr "财务成熟"

#: tarot_cards.lua:687
msgid ""
"Financial success. Prosperous leadership. Abundance with stability. Your busin"
"ess acumen is a gift."
msgstr "财务成功。繁荣的领导力。稳定中的丰盛。你的商业才干是一份天赋。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:688
msgid ""
"Miserliness. Extreme materialism. Corruption. Wealth without purpose is empty "
"and corrupts."
msgstr "吝啬。极端物质主义。腐败。没有目标的财富既空虚又会腐化人心。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:707
msgid "The Rider"
msgstr "骑士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:709
msgid "News, message, visitor, swiftness"
msgstr "消息、讯息、访客、迅速"

#: tarot_cards.lua:710
msgid ""
"News arriving. A visitor or important message. Swift movement and good tidings"
" on the horizon."
msgstr "消息即将到来。一位访客或一则重要讯息。迅速的行动与好消息已在前方。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:714
msgid "The Clover"
msgstr "四叶草"

#: tarot_cards.lua:716
msgid "Luck, opportunity, lightness, moment"
msgstr "幸运、机会、轻松、片刻"

#: tarot_cards.lua:717
msgid ""
"Passing luck. Fleeting opportunity. Simple joy. Enjoy the present moment with "
"lightness."
msgstr "短暂的好运。转瞬即逝的机会。简单的快乐。轻松地享受当下。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:721
msgid "The Ship"
msgstr "船"

#: tarot_cards.lua:723
msgid "Travel, change, adventure, movement"
msgstr "旅行、变化、冒险、移动"

#: tarot_cards.lua:724
msgid "Travel. Change of scenery. New horizons. Venture forth, the world awaits you."
msgstr "旅行。环境变化。新的视野。勇敢启程，世界正等待着你。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:728
msgid "The House"
msgstr "房屋"

#: tarot_cards.lua:730
msgid "Home, family, security, roots"
msgstr "家庭、家人、安全、根基"

#: tarot_cards.lua:731
msgid ""
"Home. Family security. Firm roots. Care for your sacred space with love and de"
"dication."
msgstr "家庭。家人的安全。稳固的根基。用爱与投入照料你的神圣空间。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:735
msgid "The Tree"
msgstr "树"

#: tarot_cards.lua:737
msgid "Health, growth, nature, vitality"
msgstr "健康、成长、自然、活力"

#: tarot_cards.lua:738
msgid ""
"Health. Personal growth. Connection with nature. Your roots are deep, your fru"
"its will come."
msgstr "健康。个人成长。与自然连接。你的根扎得很深，终会结出果实。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:742
msgid "The Clouds"
msgstr "云"

#: tarot_cards.lua:744
msgid "Confusion, uncertainty, doubt, fog"
msgstr "困惑、不确定、怀疑、迷雾"

#: tarot_cards.lua:745
msgid ""
"Confusion. Temporary uncertainty. Lingering doubts. Clarity will come after th"
"e storm passes."
msgstr "困惑。暂时的不确定。挥之不去的疑虑。风暴过去后，清晰自会到来。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:749
msgid "The Snake"
msgstr "蛇"

#: tarot_cards.lua:751
msgid "Seduction, betrayal, manipulation, cunning"
msgstr "诱惑、背叛、操控、狡猾"

#: tarot_cards.lua:752
msgid ""
"Seduction. Betrayal or manipulation. Beware of false promises. Wisdom lies in "
"seeing beyond appearances."
msgstr "诱惑。背叛或操控。警惕虚假承诺。智慧在于看穿表象。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:756
msgid "The Coffin"
msgstr "棺材"

#: tarot_cards.lua:758
msgid "Ending, transformation, loss, rebirth"
msgstr "结束、转化、失去、重生"

#: tarot_cards.lua:759
msgid ""
"End of a cycle. Deep transformation. Let the past rest. The new is born from w"
"hat has gone."
msgstr "一个周期结束。深刻转化。让过去安息。新生来自已经离去的一切。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:763
msgid "The Bouquet"
msgstr "花束"

#: tarot_cards.lua:765
msgid "Gift, compliment, beauty, gratitude"
msgstr "礼物、赞美、美丽、感激"

#: tarot_cards.lua:766
msgid ""
"Gift. Compliment. Recognition. The beauty of life reveals itself in small kind"
"nesses."
msgstr "礼物。赞美。认可。生命之美在微小的善意中显现。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:770
msgid "The Scythe"
msgstr "镰刀"

#: tarot_cards.lua:772
msgid "Cut, decision, rupture, warning"
msgstr "切断、决定、决裂、警告"

#: tarot_cards.lua:773
msgid ""
"Necessary cut. Drastic decision. Imminent rupture. Sometimes you must cut to h"
"eal."
msgstr "必要的切割。果断的决定。决裂迫在眉睫。有时必须割舍，才能疗愈。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:777
msgid "The Whip"
msgstr "鞭子"

#: tarot_cards.lua:779
msgid "Conflict, debate, passion, repetition"
msgstr "冲突、辩论、激情、重复"

#: tarot_cards.lua:780
msgid ""
"Conflict. Heated discussions. Intense passion. Channel energy into productive "
"actions."
msgstr "冲突。激烈争论。强烈激情。把能量引导到富有成效的行动上。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:784
msgid "The Birds"
msgstr "鸟"

#: tarot_cards.lua:786
msgid "Talk, gossip, communication, nervousness"
msgstr "交谈、流言、沟通、紧张"

#: tarot_cards.lua:787
msgid ""
"Important conversations. Gossip or news. Communication in focus. Choose your w"
"ords wisely."
msgstr "重要对话。流言或消息。焦点在沟通。谨慎选择言辞。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:791
msgid "The Child"
msgstr "孩子"

#: tarot_cards.lua:793
msgid "Innocence, new start, purity, playfulness"
msgstr "纯真、新开始、纯洁、童心"

#: tarot_cards.lua:794
msgid ""
"Innocence. New beginning. Purity of intention. Embrace your inner child with t"
"enderness."
msgstr "纯真。新的开始。纯洁的意图。温柔地拥抱你内在的孩子。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:798
msgid "The Fox"
msgstr "狐狸"

#: tarot_cards.lua:800
msgid "Cunning, cleverness, deceit, adaptation"
msgstr "机敏、聪慧、欺骗、适应"

#: tarot_cards.lua:801
msgid ""
"Cunning. Cleverness. Beware of deception. Use your intelligence for good, not "
"manipulation."
msgstr "机敏。聪慧。警惕欺骗。把智慧用于善意，而不是操控。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:805
msgid "The Bear"
msgstr "熊"

#: tarot_cards.lua:807
msgid "Strength, protection, power, authority"
msgstr "力量、保护、权力、权威"

#: tarot_cards.lua:808
msgid ""
"Protective strength. Financial power. Natural authority. Leadership with gener"
"osity brings prosperity."
msgstr "保护的力量。财务实力。天然权威。慷慨地领导会带来繁荣。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:814
msgid "Hope, clarity, purpose, light"
msgstr "希望、清晰、目标、光明"

#: tarot_cards.lua:815
msgid ""
"Hope. Clarity of purpose. Follow your inner light. The universe conspires in y"
"our favor."
msgstr "希望。目标清晰。跟随内在之光。宇宙正合力支持你。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:819
msgid "The Stork"
msgstr "鹳"

#: tarot_cards.lua:821
msgid "Positive change, renewal, transition, blessing"
msgstr "积极变化、更新、过渡、祝福"

#: tarot_cards.lua:822
msgid ""
"Positive change. Renewal. Blessed transition. New energies arrive to transform"
" your life."
msgstr "积极变化。更新。受祝福的过渡。新的能量到来，转化你的生活。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:826
msgid "The Dog"
msgstr "狗"

#: tarot_cards.lua:828
msgid "Friendship, loyalty, companionship, trust"
msgstr "友谊、忠诚、陪伴、信任"

#: tarot_cards.lua:829
msgid ""
"Loyal friendship. Fidelity. Sincere companionship. Value those who walk beside"
" you."
msgstr "忠诚的友谊。忠贞。真诚陪伴。珍惜与你同行的人。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:835
msgid "Authority, structure, isolation, institution"
msgstr "权威、结构、孤立、机构"

#: tarot_cards.lua:836
msgid ""
"Institutional authority. Protection. Solid structure. Build firm foundations f"
"or the future."
msgstr "机构权威。保护。稳固结构。为未来建立坚实基础。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:840
msgid "The Garden"
msgstr "花园"

#: tarot_cards.lua:842
msgid "Social life, community, meeting, public"
msgstr "社交生活、社群、聚会、公众"

#: tarot_cards.lua:843
msgid ""
"Social life. Community. Public encounters. Open yourself to new connections an"
"d environments."
msgstr "社交生活。社群。公开场合的相遇。向新的关系与环境敞开。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:847
msgid "The Mountain"
msgstr "山"

#: tarot_cards.lua:849
msgid "Obstacle, challenge, blockage, persistence"
msgstr "障碍、挑战、阻塞、坚持"

#: tarot_cards.lua:850
msgid ""
"Obstacle. Challenge to overcome. Temporary blockage. The view from the top jus"
"tifies the climb."
msgstr "障碍。需要克服的挑战。暂时受阻。登顶后的风景值得这段攀登。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:854
msgid "The Crossroads"
msgstr "十字路口"

#: tarot_cards.lua:856
msgid "Choice, decision, direction, alternative"
msgstr "选择、决定、方向、替代方案"

#: tarot_cards.lua:857
msgid ""
"Important choice. Crucial decision. Multiple paths. Follow your intuition at t"
"he crossroads."
msgstr "重要选择。关键决定。多条道路。在十字路口跟随直觉。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:861
msgid "The Mice"
msgstr "老鼠"

#: tarot_cards.lua:863
msgid "Loss, wear, worry, corrosion"
msgstr "损失、耗损、忧虑、侵蚀"

#: tarot_cards.lua:864
msgid ""
"Gradual loss. Wear and tear. Corroding worries. Attention to details that go u"
"nnoticed."
msgstr "逐渐损失。磨损。不断侵蚀的忧虑。留意那些容易被忽视的细节。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:868
msgid "The Heart"
msgstr "心"

#: tarot_cards.lua:870
msgid "Love, passion, affection, romance"
msgstr "爱、激情、情感、浪漫"

#: tarot_cards.lua:871
msgid "True love. Passion. Deep affection. Open your heart without fear of being happy."
msgstr "真爱。激情。深厚情感。敞开心扉，不要害怕获得幸福。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:875
msgid "The Ring"
msgstr "戒指"

#: tarot_cards.lua:877
msgid "Commitment, alliance, cycle, union"
msgstr "承诺、盟约、周期、结合"

#: tarot_cards.lua:878
msgid ""
"Commitment. Alliance. Completed cycle. Honor your pacts and promises with inte"
"grity."
msgstr "承诺。盟约。完整周期。以诚信信守约定与诺言。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:882
msgid "The Book"
msgstr "书"

#: tarot_cards.lua:884
msgid "Secret, knowledge, study, mystery"
msgstr "秘密、知识、学习、神秘"

#: tarot_cards.lua:885
msgid ""
"Secret. Hidden knowledge. Mystery to be revealed. The answer lies between the "
"lines."
msgstr "秘密。隐藏的知识。尚待揭晓的谜团。答案就在字里行间。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:889
msgid "The Letter"
msgstr "信"

#: tarot_cards.lua:891
msgid "Message, document, communication, news"
msgstr "讯息、文件、沟通、消息"

#: tarot_cards.lua:892
msgid ""
"Written message. Important document. Formal communication. News arriving on pa"
"per."
msgstr "书面讯息。重要文件。正式沟通。消息以书面形式到来。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:896
msgid "The Gentleman"
msgstr "男士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:898
msgid "Man, partner, action, yang"
msgstr "男性、伴侣、行动、阳"

#: tarot_cards.lua:899
msgid "Influential male figure. Partner or seeker. Yang force. Action and initiative."
msgstr "有影响力的男性人物。伴侣或问卜者。阳性能量。行动与主动性。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:903
msgid "The Lady"
msgstr "女士"

#: tarot_cards.lua:905
msgid "Woman, partner, intuition, yin"
msgstr "女性、伴侣、直觉、阴"

#: tarot_cards.lua:906
msgid ""
"Influential female figure. Partner or seeker. Yin force. Intuition and nurturi"
"ng."
msgstr "有影响力的女性人物。伴侣或问卜者。阴性能量。直觉与滋养。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:910
msgid "The Lilies"
msgstr "百合"

#: tarot_cards.lua:912
msgid "Peace, harmony, wisdom, virtue"
msgstr "和平、和谐、智慧、美德"

#: tarot_cards.lua:913
msgid "Peace. Harmony. Mature wisdom. The virtue of patience blooms in your garden."
msgstr "和平。和谐。成熟的智慧。耐心的美德在你的花园中绽放。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:919
msgid "Success, victory, energy, happiness"
msgstr "成功、胜利、能量、幸福"

#: tarot_cards.lua:920
msgid ""
"Success. Victory. Full vital energy. Everything is illuminated, enjoy this mom"
"ent."
msgstr "成功。胜利。充沛的生命能量。一切都被照亮，请享受这一刻。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:926
msgid "Recognition, fame, creativity, intuition"
msgstr "认可、名望、创造力、直觉"

#: tarot_cards.lua:927
msgid ""
"Intuition. Recognition. Fame and creativity. Your talents are recognized under"
" moonlight."
msgstr "直觉。认可。名望与创造力。你的才华在月光下获得承认。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:931
msgid "The Key"
msgstr "钥匙"

#: tarot_cards.lua:933
msgid "Solution, opening, opportunity, answer"
msgstr "解决方案、开启、机会、答案"

#: tarot_cards.lua:934
msgid ""
"Solution. Opening doors. Decisive opportunity. The answer you seek is within r"
"each."
msgstr "解决方案。开启大门。决定性的机会。你寻找的答案触手可及。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:938
msgid "The Fish"
msgstr "鱼"

#: tarot_cards.lua:940
msgid "Abundance, finances, flow, prosperity"
msgstr "丰盛、财务、流动、繁荣"

#: tarot_cards.lua:941
msgid ""
"Financial abundance. Prosperity. Flow of resources. Wealth flows like clean wa"
"ter."
msgstr "财务丰盛。繁荣。资源流动。财富如清水般流淌。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:945
msgid "The Anchor"
msgstr "锚"

#: tarot_cards.lua:947
msgid "Stability, security, work, steadfastness"
msgstr "稳定、安全、工作、坚定"

#: tarot_cards.lua:948
msgid "Stability. Lasting security. Steady work. Build solid foundations for tomorrow."
msgstr "稳定。持久的安全。稳定的工作。为明天建立坚实基础。"

#: tarot_cards.lua:952
msgid "The Cross"
msgstr "十字架"

#: tarot_cards.lua:954
msgid "Destiny, trial, burden, transcendence"
msgstr "命运、考验、重担、超越"

#: tarot_cards.lua:955
msgid ""
"Destiny. Necessary trial. Sacred burden. Suffering brings wisdom and transcend"
"ence."
msgstr "命运。必要的考验。神圣的重担。苦难带来智慧与超越。"
